# Normalise line endings. Without this, committing from Windows stores CRLF
# and the workflows then run shell steps on a Linux runner against files that
# end in \r, which fails in ways that read as a logic error rather than an
# encoding one. Text is stored LF in the repository and checked out however
# the local platform prefers.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.duckdb binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
